			"notes": "* This update brings 2 new sets of mobs with their corresponding weapons, decorative blocks, and even an armor set!\n* ADDED: Zombunnies, a set of 2 mobs (+ a rare variant) that spawn in plains and drop Markspebbles\n* ADDED: Marksblades, melee weapons made from Markspebbles, weaker damage than sword but applies Marked to target, which increases the damage of the next bullet hit\n* ADDED: Abeillons, a set of 2 mobs (+ a rare variant) that spawn in jungles and lush caves, and drop Abeillonswax\n* ADDED: Burst Rifles made from Abeillonswax\n* ADDED: Abeillon armor made from Abeillonswax, grants firing speed and ammo usage reduction, but low protection\n* ADDED: Decorative blocks made from the new mob drops (with corresponding stairs, slabs, and walls)\n* ADDED: New advancements to signal where to find the new mobs\n* CHANGED: Overworld gun recipes, pistols (like the Desert Revolver) now use 2 Gunsteel Ingots instead of a Basic Gun Assembly, while advanced guns (like the Desert Shotgun) no longer require an extra Gunsteel Ingot (but still need the Assembly)\n* CHANGED: Advancement for making a Diamond Gun Assembly is now marked as a Goal\n* FIXED: Gunomes being able to stack higher than intended\n* FIXED: Gunsmith Zombie Villagers missing a texture\n* FIXED: Crash when a Densgsten Explosive Bullet hits a block while set on fire\n* ADDED: More easter eggs on Saber Sentries (and rearranged texture location for those)"
		},
